- **Agent ID:** agent-a4
- **Provider:** codex
- **Source directory:** /Volumes/External_Disk/timo/WORDPRESS-PLUGIN-RESEARCH/plugins/pretty-link/
- **Threat context:** reports/pretty-link-threat-context.json

Read the threat context first (matched_categories + priority_vulns) before deep source review.
